{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/0109c33e5732c936cfab208abff97523.poster.avif?t=1763111062\" width=954 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/0109c33e5732c936cfab208abff97523.webm?t=1763111062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/0109c33e5732c936cfab208abff97523.mp4?t=1763111062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Wreck or Get Wrecked</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a racing game. This is a demolition playground. In our 8 player battle royale you and your friends (or Rivals!) will compete in fast paced matches where the only way to come out on top is to destroy everyone and everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/b59d10a194c2b77d6516ee055173a997.avif?t=1763111062\" width=954 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Brew Your Beast</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and mix unique traits to generate your own one-of-one DeGens in the lab. Mix together everything from cheeseburger DNA to chibi DNA to see what concoction you create. Fuse traits, reroll to generate a new creation, and build your ultimate mutant masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Deck It Before You Wreck It</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your DeGen and vehicle in the Garage!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your DeGen's personality by tricking them out in new threads, sick kicks, and dope gloves.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your vehicle by slapping on decals, customizing wheels, adding accessories, and arming it with weapons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your vehicle's performance by adjusting tuning speed, jump height, reload time, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>WTF are DeGens?!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mad scientist known only as The Doctor was hired by the government to build the ultimate super-warrior. Created in the Lab through a process known as \u201cDe-Generation\u201d he built battle \u201cDeGens\u2019 by extracting and mixing the DNA from dogs, pizza, anything imaginable. So\u2026what could go wrong? Everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, to survive, these DeGens must Smash, Crash, and Bash in deadly car battles\u2026 or risk getting sent back to the Lab for destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/da5f84f304499192e9690534b23b963c.avif?t=1763111062\" width=954 height=535 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Ways to Play - including Practice, Quickplay, and Host Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete daily Quests to earn in-game SmashCash while leveling up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build custom Degens in the Lab and infinitely customize your Avatars and vehicles in the Garage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate for supremacy in fast-paced competitive battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and declare rivalries in co-op mode with opposing Guilds. [coming soon!]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in<strong> </strong>deathmatch seasons and high-stakes tournaments to seize ultimate glory and rewards.\u00a0 [coming soon!]</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132610?t=1763111062","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/79485ff4e747b1c0b6ff7f61bc7c87950d32e964/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763111062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/5da027a01b7416e592f1534224f705dabe9f4df4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763111062","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/5da027a01b7416e592f1534224f705dabe9f4df4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763111062","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/0109c33e5732c936cfab208abff97523.poster.avif?t=1763111062\" width=954 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/0109c33e5732c936cfab208abff97523.webm?t=1763111062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/0109c33e5732c936cfab208abff97523.mp4?t=1763111062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Wreck or Get Wrecked</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a racing game. This is a demolition playground. In our 8 player battle royale you and your friends (or Rivals!) will compete in fast paced matches