nd Bash in deadly car battles\u2026 or risk getting sent back to the Lab for destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/da5f84f304499192e9690534b23b963c.avif?t=1763111062\" width=954 height=535 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Ways to Play - including Practice, Quickplay, and Host Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete daily Quests to earn in-game SmashCash while leveling up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build custom Degens in the Lab and infinitely customize your Avatars and vehicles in the Garage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate for supremacy in fast-paced competitive battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and declare rivalries in co-op mode with opposing Guilds. [coming soon!]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in<strong> </strong>deathmatch seasons and high-stakes tournaments to seize ultimate glory and rewards.\u00a0 [coming soon!]</p></li></ul>","developers":["Tevaera Labs, LLC","Look Mister, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/e91628780b939099ca608e709bc44c03ebc22b34/header.jpg?t=1763111062","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Tevaera Labs LLC. All rights reserved. <br />\r\nDegen Rivals\u2122 and Tevaera\u2122 are trademarks of Tevaera Labs LLC, registered in the United States and other jurisdictions. <br />\r\nDeveloped and published by Tevaera Labs LLC, Sheridan County, Wyoming, USA. <br />\r\nPowered by Unity\u00ae. <br />\r\nAll other trademarks and trade names are the property of their r